From: John Audia <therealgraysky@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7615: include linux/hex.h for mac_pton()

Linux 7.3 declares mac_pton() only in linux/hex.h.

Signed-off-by: John Audia <therealgraysky@proton.me>
---
--- a/mt7615/debugfs.c
+++ b/mt7615/debugfs.c
@@ -1,6 +1,9 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
 
 #include "mt7615.h"
+#if __has_include(<linux/hex.h>)
+#include <linux/hex.h>
+#endif
 
 static int
 mt7615_reg_set(void *data, u64 val)
